 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In the garden God had planted every tree was good for fruit",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the tree of life was growing where the tree of knowledge stood",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the serpent, more cunning than any creature of the field",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whispered did God really say, and the doubt began to build",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You will certainly not die, you'll be like God, the serpent lied",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So she took the fruit and ate it, gave her husband at her side",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the eyes of both were opened and they knew that they were bare",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So they sewed the fig leaves together, hid among the trees in fear",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the cool of the day",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD God called to the man",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where are you",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where are you",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I heard your voice in the garden, and I was afraid",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So I hid",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Thorns and thistles in the ground, and bread by sweat of brow",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The flaming sword is at the gate, there's no way back in now",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
